        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So I'm looking at, what exactly?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establishing some useful terminology and expanding on ideas covered in Masahiro Sakurai's video explanation of this topic, Frame Sense Trainer is a game with exercises, tutorials, examples, and tools useful to honing what this software will refer to as “Frame Sense”, or rather, “Temporal Frame Estimation” (TFE) if technical terms are preferred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What does Frame Sense Trainer have to offer?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools for frame duration visualization</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorials for learning to hone TFE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ranked leader board for exercises of various difficulty</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Okay but like, who asked?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I did! I couldn't find software for doing this so I decided to make it myself.</p>",
